/-!
# A385342

Square array A(n,k) read by descending antidiagonals, where each row n starts with an ordered list of positive integers then we swap A(n,k) with the number in the position A(n, A(n,k*n)).

The 78 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A385342

